---
import '../styles/tokens.css';
---
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>403 · 无权访问</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrap panel">
      <h1>403</h1>
      <p>当前角色无权执行此操作。operator 不能改阈值、不能做 D3 审批。</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/app/approvals">返回审批工作台</a>
    </div>
    <style>
      body { display: grid; place-items: center; min-height: 100vh; }
      .wrap { width: 420px; text-align: center; color: var(--ink-dim); }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
